[[module CSS]]
#page-title {
    display: none;
}

.content-panel p {
    padding: 0 0.75em;
}

#tagged-pages-list {
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
    column-width: 12rem;
    column-gap: 1.25rem;
    column-rule: 1px solid #888;
    counter-reset: index;
}

.tag-list ol {
    padding: 0;
    margin-block: .25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
    column-width: 12rem;
    column-gap: 1.25rem;
    column-rule: 1px solid #888;
    counter-reset: index;
}
.tag-list li {
    margin-left: 40px;
}
.tag-list ol li {
    list-style-type: var(--index);
    padding-inline-start: .5ch;
    margin-inline-start: 3.5ch;
}
.tag-list ol li::marker { font-size: .75em; }
.pages-list-item {
    margin-bottom: 0.675em;
    line-height: 1.125;
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: .175rem;
}
.pages-list-item::before {
    counter-increment: index;
    content: counter(index) ".";
    font-size: .625em;
    text-align: end;
    font-feature-settings: 'case','ss01','ss04','tnum';
}

.pages-tag-cloud-box {
    margin-top: -0.125rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    grid-gap: 0.185rem;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-block: 1.5rem;
}

#u-hidden .pages-tag-cloud-box a:not([href^="/system:page-tags/tag/_"]) {
    display: none;
}
[[/module]]

[[div class="content-panel centered standalone"]]
Welcome to the tags page! What is a tag? Find out on our [[[a-laymen-s-guide-to-tagging|Tag Guide]]]!

You can browse tags with the [#toc0 tag cloud] at the bottom, or see a [https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/tag-list comprehensive list of tags]. If you want to search for more than one tag at a time, try our advanced [[[Tag Search]]].
[[/div]]

[!-- [[module PagesByTag]] --]

[[div class="tag-list"]]
[[module ListPages category="*" order="title" separate="false" perPage="100" tags="@URL|_" prependLine="[[ol]]" appendLine="[[/ol]]" ]]
[[li style="--index: '%%index%%.'"]]
%%title_linked%%
[[/li]]
[[/module]]
[[/div]]

++ Tag Cloud:
[[module TagCloud limit="2000" target="system:page-tags" minColor="128,128,192" maxColor="153,0,17"]]

-----

[[div id="hidden"]]
[[module TagCloud limit="2000" target="system:page-tags" showHidden="true" minColor="128,128,192" maxColor="153,0,17"]]
[[/div]]

[!--
You can edit parameters of the TagCloud module as described in http://www.wikidot.com/doc:tagcloud-module
But if you want to keep the tag functionality working - do not remove these modules.
--]